THIRD-PARTY NOTICE

This project is an independent, clean-room implementation written for the
"Orchestration of AI Agents" final project. It is NOT derived from, and
contains no source code copied from, the course reference simulator
(https://github.com/rmisegal/Game-P2P-Cop-Chase), which is distributed under a
restrictive educational EULA.

What this project deliberately keeps identical to that reference is the
*interoperability surface* only — the MCP tool names, the JSON wire-message
field names, and the four report-artifact field names — because the project
book (Appendix F) mandates those as the common protocol every team must speak
in order to play against every other team. Interface names are not expressive
authorship; the implementation behind them here is entirely our own.
